00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Choose global or one-store scope
The header defines this report scope. Global figures combine recorded
store journeys, not unique central customers. Entry dates are admission
days; queued work keeps its saved cutoff.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Compare admissions with ordered stages
This synthetic global example has five admissions, four observed
journeys and ordered stages 4, 2, 1, 1, 1. One funded journey among four
recorded views is 25%; these figures are not people or revenue.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Read coverage before interpreting conversion
The preview excludes one known test journey and labels four without
established provenance. Enabled availability does not mean all traffic
was measured; missing test markers do not prove human attention.
